  "text": {
    "tagline": "Sound library for evening production.",
    "blurb": "Recorded after hours at our Onomichi studio: tine and glass electric pianos, fretless bass, reeds, muted trumpet, bells, four drum kits, and the weather outside. {count} presets for late-evening production.",
    "intro": [
      "The Rainy Loft Collection is the evening library of Harborlight Audio Works. It was recorded in our Onomichi studio after the day sessions had gone home, with the skylight open to the rain.",
      "You will find electric pianos, fretless and plucked basses, a reed, flutes, muted trumpets, bells, four drum kits, and the sounds of the town: rain, traffic, records, the espresso machine, trains and the foghorn."
    ],
    "maker_note": [
      "Play them quietly. The best take of the night is usually the last one.",
      "Onomichi Studio, Harborlight Audio Works Co., Ltd."
    ],
    "install": [
      "Insert the disc. In the Library tab it appears as RAINYLOFT.",
      "Open a folder and double-click a preset to load it.",
      "The disc's own recordings are in SOUNDS; their sources and licences are in LIBRARY.TSV and CREDITS.TXT."
